     "pk": "3992434279182783934",
     "id": "3992434279182783934_363971096",
     "caption": {
      "has_translation": null,
      "created_at": 1790155295,
      "pk": "18150528868538593",
      "text": "Nobody has seen this version of you yet. They will.\nYou’ve been working on something quietly. Not announcing it, not sure it’s ready, half expecting someone to tell you it’s a bit late for all this.\nSo you’ve kept it behind glass. Visible enough to be polite. Not close enough for anyone to see what it actually is.\nIt isn’t finished, and it doesn’t have to be. But it’s coming, and the people who get to see it will not be looking at a woman who left it too long. They’ll be looking at someone who kept going while nobody was watching.\nThat’s the work I guide women through in the Signature Course in LIT LAB — finding what’s already yours and building your signature look from it. You do it. I guide you.\nWhat are you making that nobody has seen yet?\n#signaturelook #colourstory #personalbranding #identity #ninalumi"
     },
